{status:"approved",title:"Excel Indi Frame Core",section:"Directory and serviceability guardrails",tags:["serviceability","team assignment","directory","aluminium","launch locations"],content:`Never infer product serviceability solely from a salesperson's city, nearby-city assignment, dealer, showroom or partner display. Use the Service Area matrix. Where it says Sales confirms, Proposed, TBD or sizeable projects only, do not guarantee service; refer to Sales for confirmation. Aluminium availability is a separate explicit rule and is limited to Hyderabad, Vijayawada, Rajahmundry, Warangal and Karimnagar only. Aluminium is not available outside these five launch locations. Jubilee Hills flagship is coming soon, not open yet.`}
